msgid "CMSIS-DAP"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/cmsis-dap.rst:20
msgid ""
"CMSIS-DAP is generally implemented as an on-board interface chip, providing "
"direct USB connection from a development board to a debugger running on a "
"host computer on one side, and over JTAG (Joint Test Action Group) or SWD "
"(Serial Wire Debug) to the target device to access the Coresight DAP on the "
"other. Official reference can be found `here <https://developer.mbed.org/"
"handbook/CMSIS-DAP?utm_source=platformio&utm_medium=docs>`__."
msgstr ""

